  <item>
    <title>第68讲-哥特肋</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/64f829533fa4090b744d1359</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">64f829533fa4090b744d1359</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 06 Sep 2023 07:25:05 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>|从筒形拱到交叉拱再到十字拱的演变</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhcVDPLLznJnVCZRjfe-o0U_7hcK.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>|交叉拱的缺陷</span></p><span></span><figure><br></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FphRRPJjHqcKueWlbpmek3SmLZ6L.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>|用拱肋来定型的十字拱</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoGKU5fUHa-abdvQH5IDQ7y5xt1m.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>|用尖拱解决拱高度不同的问题</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fq3Gjo0VAuzlUQVMwh6xIRDVjpAh.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>|哥特式尖拱的形成</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuFBCypnPKmuPk4_f_OPrc4gibnA.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>|哥特建筑是由尖拱构成的</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjT4niMA7Azxtu4-O3qftImytn5w.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>|用抹灰掩盖拱肋的十字拱顶</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtCJLljH437qok4dtMVvB6rm3W1K.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>|达勒姆大教堂拱顶</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvF4f6olVfJBPGhILurWMwcYW5dG.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>|哥特大教堂里轻盈的拱肋</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fkk0f5eCLews2JXxfWuKqagNEQy2.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>|亚眠大教堂的“束柱”</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsEbMI0Fi5yvlps5cGh2irvFi5ul.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>|“束柱”其实是“附柱”</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhBMwDtFH4Fqd7Qy_lD9LlcKXk-p.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>|线脚瓦解了洞口的厚度</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fn2uw5fsaA_jtwGKG71ISsfWxDnU.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>|索尔兹伯里大教堂的伞状拱肋</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fk4ixL9qVHsvjK5_3UpK3cd1Pyvb.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>|彼得勃鲁大教堂的伞状拱肋</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkYbDEB-YnhH42r8CN4jd8XrKYwb.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>|威尔斯大教堂的网状拱肋</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpGfxelnHAf-k-N5TnWOzyE1mRtO.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>|格劳切斯特大教堂的蕾丝拱肋</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FopLvCDQU4ybkBKbp2d0w525Pb64.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>|威斯敏斯特大教堂里的蕾丝拱肋</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fo3-lifkARyUF5SimQdgWIs9SazG.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>|晚期哥特的屋顶与吊顶</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlRPNqWl3XnRbQci3fOICDCfXC4c.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
